      "source": [
        "Weather columns `T_out`, `Press_mm_hg`, `RH_out`, `Windspeed`, `Visibility`, `Tdewpoint` come from the Chièvres airport station at **hourly** resolution and were interpolated to 10 min (per the dataset description). They are therefore observations, not forecasts, and are used **lagged only**.\n",
        "\n",
        "## 2. Chronological split\n",
        "The split is made on the sorted row index **before** any fitting, so every later step (imputer, scaler, feature selection, EDA used for decisions, early stopping, HPO) can respect it."
      ]
    },
